# `@gitru/ui`

Design system on **coss/ui** (Base UI), shadcn-like DX.

- Prefer existing components in `packages/ui/src/components/` before inventing new primitives
- Compose coss patterns correctly (triggers, portals, accessibility)
- Agent skill: `.agents/skills/coss/`
- External docs map: https://coss.com/ui/llms.txt

Consumers import like `@gitru/ui/components/button` and `@gitru/ui/lib/utils` (`cn`).
